      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps",
      "start_timestamp": "00:40",
      "end_timestamp": "00:48",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Honestly, once or twice a day. I'd give it a three, out of ten. I've been feeling faint too, for about four days.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:49",
      "end_timestamp": "01:01",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "nurse",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. BP is 96 over 65, pulse 106, temp 36.9 degrees, oxygen saturation is 96 percent.",
